  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The pressure at the bottom of the lake can be calculated as follows:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pa</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Pa</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>As the temperature of water remains constant, it can be written that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>bottom</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>bottom</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>top</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>top</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (1) to calculate the required volume of the bubble when it reaches the surface.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>top</mi></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>top</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
